
Introduction:
-------------

This package provides all the relevant scripts that are used to create reduced ntuples for the 
paired dijet analysis (narrow and wide resonance search, run2 and run3 processing), perform 
various studies for the analysis (bias studies, data/MC comparisons, signal shapes, interpolation, 
trigger efficiency, run with screens or condor, noise filters, jet veto maps etc) and perform background
or signal plus background fits, produce datacards, extract limits and significances.

The newest HiggsCombine v10 version is built for CMSSW_14_1_0_pre4, so all the above can be done there.

Instructions:
-------------

1) Environment setup:
    mkdir 4jets/
    cd 4jets/
    cmsrel CMSSW_14_1_0_pre4
    cd CMSSW_14_1_0_pre4/src/ 
    cmsenv	   

2) Download the code:
    git clone -b PairedDijetAnalysis https://github.com/CMSDIJET/DijetRootTreeAnalyzer.git CMSDIJET/DijetRootTreeAnalyzer

3) Compile:
    cd CMSSW_14_1_0_pre4/src/ 
    scram b -j 8
    
    This should give no errors.

3) Go inside:
    cd CMSDIJET/DijetRootTreeAnalyzer


